# Mac part a of the weekly set, matrices/dashboard-text-v1.cells: Qwen3 0.6B, Qwen3 1.7B and Gemma 4 E2B on every
# arm, then the ONNX Runtime GenAI rows of Qwen3 0.6B and 1.7B. The SAME cells, split in two for the night job: the
# whole Mac set (61 cells) outgrew one sitting's 5-hour timeout (2026-10-28: cut after 300 min at 58 of 61 cells,
# 24 gate re-runs), so the job measures the Mac's week as two sittings on two firings, part b first
# (ops/dashboard-v1/schedule.json m4max "parts"; docs/dashboard-recurring-job-v1.md §3, "The Mac set in two parts").
# Each part starts with the session anchor row, as every Android half does, and each sitting has its own anchor
# phase and admission: no number is pooled across the two sessions. Rows are byte-identical to the parent file and
# in its order; every arm of a model is in one part, so a model's cross-arm comparison stays in one session. The
# anchor row aside: part b measures it too, and runs first in the week, so that the page's Qwen3 0.6B MLX
# short-chat number comes from this part's session, with the model's other arms. A Mac row added to the parent goes
# into its model's part at the same place (scripts/dashboard_job_selftest.py holds the parts to the parent).
#   ./bench matrix matrices/dashboard-text-v1-mac-a.cells --platform mac

# --- Qwen3-0.6B ---
mac mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit short-chat anchor=1 runs=3
mac litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B/dynamic_wi4b32_afp32 short-chat
mac llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF/Q4_K_M short-chat
mac core-ai core-ai/qwen3-0.6b-4bit-gpu short-chat
mac executorch own-export/Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-xnnpack-8da4w-emb8-ctx2048 short-chat backend=xnnpack local=1 file=Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-xnnpack-8da4w-emb8-ctx2048.pte recipe=et1.5.1-xnnpack-8da4w-g128-emb8
mac executorch own-export/Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048 short-chat backend=mlx local=1 file=Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048.pte recipe=et1.5.1-mlx-4w-g128-emb8
mac mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit long-context-1024-gen256
mac litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B/dynamic_wi4b32_afp32 long-context-1024-gen256 context-tokens=2048
mac llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF/Q4_K_M long-context-1024-gen256 context-tokens=2048
mac executorch own-export/Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-xnnpack-8da4w-emb8-ctx2048 long-context-1024-gen256 backend=xnnpack local=1 file=Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-xnnpack-8da4w-emb8-ctx2048.pte recipe=et1.5.1-xnnpack-8da4w-g128-emb8 context-tokens=2048
mac executorch own-export/Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048 long-context-1024-gen256 backend=mlx local=1 file=Qwen3-0.6B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048.pte recipe=et1.5.1-mlx-4w-g128-emb8 context-tokens=2048

